 "sentences": [
  {
   "s": 0.0,
   "e": 3.96,
   "text": "Your room doesn't get messy on Sunday, it gets messy ten minutes at a time."
  },
  {
   "s": 4.4,
   "e": 8.0,
   "text": "Mira cleaned her flat every Sunday. Dishes, laundry the desk, the kitchen,"
  },
  {
   "s": 8.2,
   "e": 12.56,
   "text": "four hours every single week. And by Wednesday, it looked exactly the same again."
  },
  {
   "s": 13.16,
   "e": 15.76,
   "text": "That's over two hundred hours a year cleaning up the same week."
  },
  {
   "s": 16.14,
   "e": 20.36,
   "text": "So she tried something much smaller, every night at nine a ten-minute timer in one rule,"
  },
  {
   "s": 20.88,
   "e": 25.5,
   "text": "everything goes back where it lives. Not a deep clean, just three things. Dishes in the sink,"
  },
  {
   "s": 25.5,
   "e": 29.92,
   "text": "clothes off the chair and the desk cleared. The hard part night three, she was tired and"
  },
  {
   "s": 29.92,
   "e": 34.02,
   "text": "the sink was full, she did it anyway because it was only ten minutes. Two weeks later,"
  },
  {
   "s": 34.1,
   "e": 38.7,
   "text": "her Sunday was free. The flat never got past ten minutes of mess and the whole week took"
  },
  {
   "s": 38.7,
   "e": 43.66,
   "text": "seventy minutes not two hundred and forty. Clean in small pieces the same way the mess arrives,"
  },
  {
   "s": 44.12,
   "e": 47.92,
   "text": "screenshot this, send it to the friend who loses every Sunday to cleaning."
  },
  {
   "s": 48.4,
   "e": 52.74,
   "text": "Mira got her Sundays back ten minutes at a time, your bigger goals work the same way."
  },
  {
   "s": 52.74,
   "e": 58.28,
   "text": "That's what Demure is for. You archive your dream today so you can see it tomorrow and break it down"
  },
  {
   "s": 58.28,
   "e": 62.44,
   "text": "into small steps you can actually do. Follow for one fix a day. Next,"
  },
  {
   "s": 62.7,
   "e": 67.48,
   "text": "while lifting the same weight stops working. If you want to try it out, I've put the link in the bio."
  }
 ],
 "wps": 3.5
